WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.056
Media decisions follow a logic flow.

00:00:03.106 --> 00:00:04.978
Start with the journey stage.

00:00:05.028 --> 00:00:06.877
Find the bond or barrier.

00:00:06.927 --> 00:00:07.727
Set the media role.

00:00:07.304 --> 00:00:13.738
Then narrow down channel, platform and environment, guided by eight inputs.

00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:19.029
NRMA Insurance in Queensland had a barrier: locals saw it as an outsider.

00:00:19.079 --> 00:00:22.487
So media's role was building local credibility.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.284
The environment was The Courier Mail.

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:28.398
A Help Our Highway partnership pushed to fix the Bruce Highway,

00:00:28.448 --> 00:00:31.926
and the government committed four hundred and sixty-seven million dollars.

00:00:32.633 --> 00:00:33.786
Use it like this:

00:00:33.836 --> 00:00:35.213
name the barrier first,

00:00:35.263 --> 00:00:36.063
make the media role answer it,

00:00:35.487 --> 00:00:38.879
then pick the place.
